---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Projects" description="Selected work by Shane Tarleton: a patent for hierarchical data display and the Cirrus Solutions Subcontractor Portal.">
  <header class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Selected work</p><h1>Ideas put to work.</h1><p class="intro">Two highlights from a career spent making complex systems more useful.</p></header>
  <article class="project" id="hierarchical-data-display">
    <p class="eyebrow">01 / US Patent / Named inventor</p>
    <h2>Hierarchical data display</h2>
    <p>A system for organizing and presenting hierarchical enterprise data. The patent describes interpreting parent-child relationships, accumulating attributes, and rendering graphical cards that help people navigate the data.</p>
    <dl><dt>My role</dt><dd>Named inventor, alongside the other inventors listed in the patent.</dd><dt>Patent</dt><dd>US10990255B1</dd></dl>
    <a href="https://patents.google.com/patent/US10990255B1">Read the patent <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
  </article>
  <article class="project" id="subcontractor-portal">
    <p class="eyebrow">02 / Cirrus Solutions / Sole developer</p>
    <h2>Subcontractor Portal</h2>
    <p>A workflow connecting dealers and subcontractors, from dispatch to completed-work invoices. The public launch announcement describes dispatch by text or email, documented two-way communication, and AI-assisted invoice attachment to the corresponding job.</p>
    <dl><dt>My role</dt><dd>Sole developer of the Subcontractor Portal.</dd><dt>Announced</dt><dd>September 16, 2026</dd></dl>
    <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/pulse/cirrus-solutions-launches-ai-powered-subcontractor-sk6ae/">Read the launch announcement <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
  </article>
  <p class="source-note">Descriptions are limited to publicly available sources and my stated roles. Employer-owned implementation details are not shared here.</p>
</Layout>
